# The Mine Glove in the left hand (Akimbo): its mines thrown by the left hand (a tester's log on Orxon has theirs thrown
# that way; the same day's picture: "one of my mines became an oval"). The left glove is a second glove the game does not
# know of: its mine updates with the hand slot lent to it, and from 0.1.18 the left hand's item is held mirrored.
# QUEST_SIM_GIVE=15,17 QUEST_SIM_HOLD=15 QUEST_SIM_LEFT=17 QUEST_ROWS_TRACE=74 on Novalis (--level 1): "[sim] rows tick N:
# slot S class 74 ... (even)" for each mine and no "(UNEVEN)"; the shots are to be looked at.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3200 shot ahead
